WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.289
Open Community.

2
00:00:01.409 --> 00:00:03.719
Choose Community from More resources.

3
00:00:03.839 --> 00:00:08.797
Switch between discussions, strategies, chart competition, and leaderboards.

4
00:00:09.833 --> 00:00:11.191
Prepare a discussion.

5
00:00:11.311 --> 00:00:14.933
Return to Discussions and enter a clear title and explanation.

6
00:00:15.053 --> 00:00:18.861
This example prepares a draft without publishing to real users.

7
00:00:19.916 --> 00:00:21.240
Review public sharing.

8
00:00:21.360 --> 00:00:24.216
Open Leaderboards to inspect the sharing controls.

9
00:00:24.336 --> 00:00:30.024
Sharing a portfolio snapshot is optional, and virtual account value is not a measure of trading skill.

